MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink doorbell feels like a useful next addition because it adds front-door alerts and two-way communication alongside my existing camera, provided they work together.",
    "Alexa-compatible devices fit my Fire TV setup, and extra storage could support my camcorder recordings, although neither creates an immediate need."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The HD Fire TV Stick duplicates functions I already have through my 4K stick and Fire TV television, while the Blink bundle includes cameras that overlap with mine.",
    "Earbuds and a USB-B cable do not address a current need suggested by my home video and security purchases."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning Fire TV devices seems to have been taken as a reason to offer several Alexa speakers, even though I have no specific need for another voice-control device.",
    "My electronics purchases seem to have been interpreted as broad interest in electronics accessories, regardless of whether they serve my current setup."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I already own matters: I am more interested in adding a useful capability than buying another device that does the same thing.",
    "I need a concrete use before choosing an accessory; possible future storage or appliance automation needs are less compelling than front-door monitoring."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in connected home video and security, but overlook the difference between a useful addition and redundant equipment."
}
